        "title": "Join travel and its purpose",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "With the same subject, put the travel or means first and the purpose afterward. You do not need an English-style infinitive marker.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我去学校唱歌。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ qù xuéxiào chàng gē 。",
                "meaning": "I go to school to sing.",
